<title>JAPAN: Fuji Heavy shares up in active trade.</title>
<headline>Fuji Heavy shares up in active trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd were higher in heavy trade having lagged the recent rally in car shares, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0132 GMT, Fuji Heavy was up 15 yen at 555.</p>
<p>Turnover was 3.45 million shares.  </p>
<p>&quot;Fuji Heavy is drawing attention as an issue which lagged the recent rally in car shares,&quot; an official of a major securities house said. its share price rising further. Relatively low prices are encouraging buying by individual investors,&quot; an official of a medium-sized brokerage said.</p>
</text>
